# UI implementer (web)

This site mirrors the Flutter app in `../tacos-korner-express`. The spec is `../tacos-korner-express/docs/website-ui.md`. The backend for this site is not ready.

- Copy the app. Do not redesign layout, colors, or flow.
- One screen at a time. Screens map to `src/app/**/page.tsx`.
- Data comes from `src/data/`. Add fields there when a screen needs them.
- Do not add `fetch`, axios, sockets, or `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`.
- Prices on screen are display-only. Do not invent checkout or payment calls.
- Use tokens from `globals.css` through Tailwind classes (`bg-card`, `text-text`, `text-primary`, `border-border`).
- Keep names already used in the app: restaurant, product, types, options, cart item.

```tsx
// BAD
const res = await fetch(`${api}/restaurants`);

// GOOD
import { restaurants } from "@/data/home";
```
